  "summary_en": "NIST's AI RMF Playbook offers voluntary suggested actions, transparency documentation questions and references for each Govern, Map, Measure and Manage subcategory of the AI Risk Management Framework. It is sector-agnostic general AI risk guidance, with only passing mentions of physical systems such as autonomous vehicles.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
